Put both files in the same folder:

student-records/
├── app.js
└── students.json

Then open the terminal in that folder and run:

node app.js

It will automatically create:

report.json

So your final folder will be:

student-records/
├── app.js
├── students.json
└── report.json

You can then push these files to your GitHub repository.
